 "1.17": "he pṛthivīpate (O lord of the earth!), parameṣv-āsaḥ kāśyaḥ ca (and great bowman the king of Kaśi), mahā-rathaḥ śikhaṇḍī ca (and great warrior Śikhandin), dhṛṣṭa-dyumnaḥ (Dhṛṣṭadyumna), virāṭaḥ ca (and Virāṭa), aparājitaḥ sātyakiḥ (invincible Sātyaki), drupadaḥ (Drupada), draupadeyāḥ ca (and sons of Drupada’s daughter), mahā-bāhuḥ saubhadraḥ ca (and powerful son of Subhadrā) sarvaśaḥ (altogether) pṛthak pṛthak (respective) śaṅkhān (conchshells) dadhmuḥ (they blew).",
